id=gms_millet_guard
name=Millet Guard
version=2.0.6
versionCode=206
author=E3N
summary=Configurable HyperOS Millet/Greeze no-restrict guard
description=Keeps user-selected apps in MILLET_NO_RESTRICT_APP while preserving unrelated entries. Includes Xiaomi GMS limiter handling, DNS-aware FCM recovery, lost-reconnect-alarm self-healing, serialized firewall repair, and race-safe stale-lock handling.
